# D3-MI-004: Equal copper amounts need not give the same mineral acid demand
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
add v1 water 50mL
add v1 atacamite 0.0003mol
add v2 water 50mL
add v2 antlerite 0.0002mol
add v1 HCl 0.001mol
add v2 HCl 0.001mol
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
measure v1 uvvis
measure v2 uvvis
particles v1
particles v2
inspect
